WEBVTT

00:32:58.798 --> 00:33:03.505
and then it would open up
a whole new world of what was possible,

00:33:03.529 --> 00:33:05.629
you know, be it fundraising numbers

00:33:05.653 --> 00:33:09.116
or opening X number
of buildings in a month,

00:33:09.140 --> 00:33:12.950
or selling so many seats
to new members on a certain month.

00:33:12.974 --> 00:33:19.172
We would consistently set out
fairly audacious goals and hit them.

00:33:20.645 --> 00:33:22.030
AG: Stretch goals.

00:33:22.054 --> 00:33:25.127
Sometimes those kinds of moonshots
are just the fuel we need.

00:33:25.151 --> 00:33:26.522
There's a wealth of evidence

00:33:26.546 --> 00:33:29.689
that extremely difficult specific goals
motivate us to aim higher.

00:33:29.713 --> 00:33:31.727
And work harder, longer and smarter.